<p>
  <%= link_to "Finish starting #{@group_name}", sign_up_confirmation_url(token: @token) %>.

  The link works once and expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, SignUp::EXPIRES_IN) %>.
  It opens a page with a button on it; no account and no group exist until you press that button.
</p>

<p>
  If you did not ask to start a group, ignore this message and the link expires unused.
  Nothing has been created in your name.
</p>
